      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1001 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Since 2020 GPE continues to strive for providing reliable, efficient &amp; cost effective projects to many Local and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1001 characters\">Multinational Companies on Turnkey Basis. We are committed to follow engineering code of practice/standards<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1001 characters\">with HSE at the top and client&#8217;s ultimate satisfaction.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
