      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"444 characters\">Grison Power Engineering &#8211; GPE was established in the year 2020 as Supplier &amp;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"444 characters\">constructors with an aim to serve the nation professionally in the fields of Civil,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
